{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "8abfa4d7-1eda-41b7-be2c-93a15383d831", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 19, "ts": "2026-07-23T15:49:16.913000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/arch/arm64/src/common/arm64_allocateheap.c", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-0", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/arch/arm64/src/common/arm64_allocateheap.c"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "8abfa4d7-1eda-41b7-be2c-93a15383d831", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 20, "ts": "2026-07-23T15:49:22.914000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/arch/arm64/src/common/arm64_internal.h", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-1", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/arch/arm64/src/common/arm64_internal.h"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "8abfa4d7-1eda-41b7-be2c-93a15383d831", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 21, "ts": "2026-07-23T15:49:40.918000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "找到了。从 `cmake_out/kickpi-k7_nsh/include/nuttx/config.h` 可以确认：\n\n```c\n#define CONFIG_RAM_END (CONFIG_RAM_START+CONFIG_RAM_SIZE)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 正确解释\n\n主堆的注册流程：\n\n```\nup_allocate_heap():\n  *heap_size = CONFIG_RAM_END - g_idle_topstack\n             = (CONFIG_RAM_START + CONFIG_RAM_SIZE) - g_idle_topstack\n```\n\n也就是说 **`CONFIG_RAM_SIZE` 定义了主堆物理边界**，不是\"整个堆\"，而是\"从 `RAM_START` 开始的这段连续物理内存的可用范围\"。\n\n为什么不能直接覆盖整 4G？因为：\n\n1. **`CONFIG_RAM_END` = `0x40200000 + 136314880 = 0x48400000`** — 恰好是 OP-TEE 保留区起点\n2. OP-TEE 在 `0x48400000~0x49400000`，这段 16MB **不能被 NuttX 当作堆**（secure world）\n3. 所以主堆只能止于 `0x48400000`\n\n而 `0x49400000` 之后的大块内存（~3.86G）不连续，无法和一个从 `0x40200000` 起的主堆合并，只能作为**独立的第二个 region** 追加进去。\n\n### 堆的最终全貌\n\n```\nRegion 0 (主堆): 0x40200000 → 0x48400000 (~130MB)    ← CONFIG_RAM_SIZE 控制上限\nRegion 1 (附加): 0x49400000 → DDR末端 (~3.86G)        ← arm64_addregion() 追加\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n堆总计:            ~4GB\n```\n\n所以：**`CONFIG_RAM_SIZE` 只是 region 0 的物理上限，不是整个堆的总大小。** 两个 region + 起来才是完整堆，当前配置已经正确覆盖 4G。"}
